# NOTE ON data/raw/ AND data/processed/ -- DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED.
#
# data/raw/ holds cached Open-Meteo and Overpass responses (~18 MB). Committing
# them is a deliberate choice:
#
#   * a fresh clone can run the whole pipeline in ~7 s, fully offline
#   * teammates do not each spend 30-60 min re-hammering a rate-limited public
#     Overpass instance for data that does not change
#   * the demo requirement is that it works with the network off; shipping the
#     cache is what makes that true from a clean checkout
#
# If the repo later grows past a few hundred MB, revisit: move the cache to a
# release asset or Git LFS rather than silently dropping it, because losing it
# means losing offline reproducibility.

# --- frontend ---
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
